[[File:Golden Dawn Institute.png|thumb|300px|right]]
The '''Golden Dawn Institute''' is a floating building located by the entrance to the high elven capital of [[Alah'Thalas]] that serves host to refugees and travellers from afar. The grounds below the institute leading to the gates of the city are host to a ranger training ground, an auction house and bank, Tiriel Brightwater's inn that additionally serves as a home to refugees, and the sanctum of the Grand Magistrix of the Silvermoon Remnant, [[Grand Magistrix Merisa Dawnbreaker|Merisa Dawnbreaker]].

