'''Gol'Bolar Quarry''' is a large dig site found in southeastern [[Dun Morogh]]. It is the location of a small dwarven mining camp where young dwarves and gnomes can receive missions to exterminate the [[trogg]]s who have overrun the excavation site and the [[Gol'Bolar Quarry Mine]].  There are also some [[vendor]]s and [[profession]] [[trainer]]s here ready to aid fresh-faced adventurers in any way they can.

