The '''Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility''' is the result of [[Gnome|gnomekind]]'s collective efforts to reclaim their city. Located in [[Dun Morogh]], it is the fruit of gnomekind's collective efforts as it serves as the new home for the [[Gnomeregan Exiles]] and a new primary home and a step forward for [[Gnomeregan]]'s reclamation.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

Former residents of [[Tinker Town]] in [[Ironforge]] have relocated here, along with new gnomes joining the cause. The facility provides quests for reclaiming Gnomeregan, including a section overrun by toxic components.

