The '''Gor'dosh tribe'''<ref name="The Maul Orb">{{questlong|Horde|53|The Maul Orb}}</ref> (or '''Gor'dosh Ogres''')<ref name="Gor'dosh Ogres">{{questlong|Alliance|51|The Gor'dosh Ogres}}</ref> are a group of [[ogre]]s residing in [[Lapidis Isle]]. They formerly dominated both Lapidis and [[Gillijim's Isle]], but the tribe later split, with the Gillijim ogres becoming the [[Maul'ogg]].<ref name="The Maul Orb" />

Upon the arrival of the [[Kul Tiran Exploratory Fleet]] on Lapidis Isle, the Gor'dosh made battle with them constantly until they were driven back.<ref name="Gor'dosh Ogres" />

